<Layout title="Privacy & enquiries | Linis Co"><article class="wrap detail-hero privacy"><div class="eyebrow">YOUR DETAILS, HANDLED WITH CARE</div><h1>Privacy & enquiries</h1><p>This website prepares an enquiry in your browser. It does not submit or store your form details on a server. You choose whether to copy your enquiry and send it to Linis Co through Messenger.</p><h2>When you contact us</h2><p>Messenger and Facebook operate under Meta’s privacy policies. Information you send there is shared with Linis Co to discuss your request. Avoid including sensitive information. Contact the team at +63 961 806 2218 for questions about information you have shared.</p><h2>External services</h2><p>This site loads illustrative photography from Unsplash. The image provider receives standard network information when your browser requests images. Read our <a href="/cookies">cookie information</a> for hosting and browser controls.</p><h2>Booking and quotes</h2><p>Preparing an enquiry does not confirm a booking. Services, availability, price and scope must be agreed directly with the team. This site does not accept payment.</p></article></Layout>

